  "text": "24 Hour Emergency Vet | Metropolitan Veterinary Hospital\nSkip to Primary Content\nFind a Location\nEmergency\nEmergency\nInternships\nExternships\nResidency\nCareers\nAbout\nAbout Us\nAffiliated Partners\nNews & Blog\nAcademy\nMetroCares\nGood Samaritan Program\nContact Us\nOur Team\nAkron Team\nCleveland East Team\nAdmin Team\nView Full Team\nServices\nEmergency\nCritical Care\nAvian & Exotics\nBlood Bank\nCardiology\nInternal Medicine\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOncology\nOphthalmology\nSurgery\nRadioactive Iodine Therapy (I-131)\nView all Services\nPet Owners\nPet Owners FAQ\nDocuments & Forms\nFor Veterinarians\nReferrals\nContinuing Education\nClinical Trials\nCurrent Clinical Trials\nPet Owner Information\nVeterinarian Information\nFind a Location\nEmergency\nMetroCares Good Samaritan Fund\nMetropolitan Veterinary Hospital is proud to announce the creation of our MetroCares Good Samaritan Fund, a fund aimed at providing emergency medical care for homeless and abandoned pets, right here in our community.\nLearn More\nMetropolitan Veterinary Hospital\nComprehensive Specialty & Emergency Care\nEmergency\nMetropolitan Veterinary Hospital\nTwo locations providing comprehensive specialty and emergency care in northeast Ohio.\nFind a Location\nMetroCares Good Samaritan Fund\nMetropolitan Veterinary Hospital is proud to announce the creation of our MetroCares Good Samaritan Fund, a fund aimed at providing emergency medical care for homeless and abandoned pets, right here in our community.\nLearn More\nMetropolitan Veterinary Hospital\nComprehensive Specialty & Emergency Care\nEmergency\nMetropolitan Veterinary Hospital\nTwo locations providing comprehensive specialty and emergency care in northeast Ohio.\nFind a Location\nMetroCares Good Samaritan Fund\nMetropolitan Veterinary Hospital is proud to announce the creation of our MetroCares Good Samaritan Fund, a fund aimed at providing emergency medical care for homeless and abandoned pets, right here in our community.\nLearn More\nYou love your pet 24/7...so do we!\nServing Pets and their Families Since 1968\nWhen an urgent situation arises, the Emergency Department at Metropolitan Veterinary Hospital acts as an extension of your primary veterinarian. Metropolitan Veterinary Hospital’s team of emergency veterinarians and highly trained technical staff provides high quality care. We also have access to state-of-the-art diagnostic technology and treatments to accommodate any trauma or illness through our wide range of specialty services.\nOur Team\nOur team of dedicated doctors, specialists, and technical staff are here to help your pet every step of the way.\nOur Team\nEmergency Care\n24/7 Emergency and Critical Care is offered at our hospitals.\nEmergency\nSpecialty Care\nOur hospitals offer a broad range of veterinary specialties.\nServices\nOur Team\nOur team of dedicated doctors, specialists, and technical staff are here to help your pet every step of the way.\nOur Team\nEmergency Care\n24/7 Emergency and Critical Care is offered at our hospitals.\nEmergency\nSpecialty Care\nOur hospitals offer a broad range of veterinary specialties.\nServices\nOur Team\nOur team of dedicated doctors, specialists, and technical staff are here to help your pet every step of the way.\nOur Team\nEmergency Care\n24/7 Emergency and Critical Care is offered at our hospitals.\nEmergency\nSpecialty Care\nOur hospitals offer a broad range of veterinary specialties.\nServices\nOur Team\nOur team of dedicated doctors, specialists, and technical staff are here to help your pet every step of the way.\nOur Team\nCardiology\nEmergency\nCritical Care\nAvian & Exotics\nBlood Bank\nCardiology\nEmergency\nCritical Care\nAvian & Exotics\nBlood Bank\nCardiology\nEmergency\nCritical Care\nAvian & Exotics\nBlood Bank\nCardiology\nSurgery\nInternal Medicine\nNeurology\nOncology\nOphthalmology\nSurgery\nInternal Medicine\nNeurology\nOncology\nOphthalmology\nSurgery\nInternal Medicine\nNeurology\nOncology\nOphthalmology\nSurgery\nAbout Our Hospital\nMetropolitan Veterinary Hospital will always combine teamwork, training, and technology to create your pet's happiest, healthiest life.\nAbout Us\nClient Reviews & Testimonials\nMy husband and I took our young kitty here for a cardiologist appointment and every staff member I spoke to was insanely kind and friendly. I felt very comfortable here even though we aren't from around the area. Thankful that lil Hashbrown is just fine and thankful for their attentive care for our pet.\nMegan T.\nWe have taken two of our dogs here. Their doctors are very thorough and knowledgeable. The hospital staff are very caring. This last visit we saw Dr. Brie Anne Mauser. She walked through our options in detail. Your pets will receive good care here.\nCindy D.\nWe took our cat here when he was expeiencing pain from a soft tissue injury in his hip. Dr. Page and all the staff were very professional and friendly. The doctor prescribed some anti inflammatory meds and based on her examination, she recommended not spending the extra money on X Rays because our cat exhibited no signs of a fracture. Very honest people here who care about pets and their owners. Highly recommended.\nDaniel C.\nAbout Us\nOur Team\nView all Services\nPet Owners\nFor Veterinarians\nLocations\nTerms & Conditions\nPrivacy Policy\nAccessibility\nCookie Preferences\nDo Not Sell or Share My Information\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
